{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10105","headline":"伤吴中 · 李嘉佑","name":"伤吴中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"馆娃宫中春已归，阖闾城头莺已飞。\n复见花开人又老，横塘寂寂柳依依。\n忆昔吴王在宫阙，馆娃满眼看花发。\n舞袖朝欺陌上春，歌声夜怨江边月。\n古来人事亦犹今，莫厌清觞与绿琴。\n独向西山聊一笑，白云芳草自知心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李嘉佑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10105.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10105","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}